# Northern Dark — mandatory altar pocket (3×3 open floor, impassable altar overlay at center).
# Always placed exactly once somewhere in northern_dark (random anchor per run; see §7.6).
# When Floor 1 rift policy has riftPedestalAltar, bump is replaced by offering altar (Rift-Requirements §5).
VAULT vault_altar_3x3
WEIGHT 1
MIN_DISTANCE_FROM_PLAYER_START 0
ORIGIN 1 1
TILES .=DcssCavern:grey_dirt_0_new;A=DcssCavern:altar_misc
MAP
...
.A.
...
ENDMAP
INTERACTABLE bump_altar_indentations AT 1 1
END
